			"notes": "- Updated to Minecraft 26.3\n- Embedded owo-lib's UI system into the mod, meaning owo-lib is no longer a required dependency\n  - This was done to make keeping the mod updated and quickly released much easier\n- Rewrote image clipboard handling, allowing macOS users to now copy images to clipboards\n  - This also seems to fix images that were previously too large for the clipboard, well, not be too large for it (in limited testing on linux)\n- Fixed the mod causing the game to not launch on certain macOS setups\n- Fixed picture in picture renderers not working properly in container screen renders, causing stuff like Smithing Table menu to not show the armor stand\n- Added some extra padding to tooltip renders to fix certain custom tooltip styles being cropped off"
		},
